{"id":"derecho","lemma":"derecho","pos":"noun","rank":458,"glosses":["right (a legal, just or moral entitlement)","law, jurisprudence (the study of laws)","law (the profession of dealing with laws (as lawyers, judges, etc.))"],"ipa":"/deˈɾet͡ʃo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"derechos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-derecho.wav","formAudio":{"derechos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-derechos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom decidió estudiar Derecho.","en":"Tom decided to study law.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75263"},{"text":"Todos tenemos derechos y deberes.","en":"We all have rights and responsibilities.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152203"},{"text":"Fui derecho a la cama.","en":"I went straight to bed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460906"},{"text":"Él fue despojado de sus derechos civiles.","en":"He was deprived of his civil rights.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514858"},{"text":"Mi brazo derecho es fuerte.","en":"My right arm is strong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456598"}]}